id: og_foundry
name: Foundry
description: Foundry. A production line you fight along in the order the work went through it, from the receiving yard to the shipping dock, with the maintenance route running above all of it. Built as a heavy castings works; the line stopped in the middle of a pour and nobody came back for it.

grid: 1.7
wall_thickness: 0.32

layer works z=0 height=5.00 roof=yes

legend
  A  shipping          "Shipping"  lane  h=5.0
  B  quality           "Quality"  room  h=4.2
  C  pour_floor        "Pour Floor"  site  h=5.0
  D  racking           "Racking"  room  h=5.0
  E  receiving         "Receiving"  spawn  h=5.0
  0  shipping_cover    "Pallets"  cover=1.2  as=crate
